Package: bedc
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Direct Connect client for V\OS
 BDirectConnect is a chat-oriented Direct Connect client: connect to a hub,
 join channels, talk to other users and browse shared directories, with
 link statistics and message wrapping in the channel view.
